/index.html
/modules/
/ui/
</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Once it exists, the 404 disappears instantly.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h2 class="text-xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-3.5 pb-1"><strong>Option 2 — Add a </strong><code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">&lt;link rel="icon"&gt;</code><strong> tag to your HTML</strong></h2><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">If you want to use a PNG instead of an ICO, add this to your <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">&lt;head&gt;</code>:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">html</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm"><span initial="start" animate="end" variants="[object Object]" custom="0"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span> <span class="hljs-attr">rel</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"icon"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">type</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"image/png"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">href</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"./favicon.png"</span>&gt;</span></span><span initial="start" animate="end" variants="[object Object]" custom="0">
</span></code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Then put <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">favicon.png</code> in the root of your repo.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h2 class="text-xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-3.5 pb-1"><strong>Option 3 — Silence the request completely</strong></h2><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">If you don’t want a favicon at all, add this to your <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">&lt;head&gt;</code>:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">html</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm"><span initial="start" animate="end" variants="[object Object]" custom="0"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span> <span class="hljs-attr">rel</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"icon"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">href</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"data:,"</span>&gt;</span></span><span initial="start" animate="end" variants="[object Object]" custom="0">
</span></code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">This tells the browser “there is no favicon,” and it stops requesting one.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ Important: This error does NOT affect your antenna designer</h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Your app is now working — the dropdown is showing <strong>undefined</strong> because your registry or dropdown loader still needs one more fix.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">If you want, I can:</span></p><ul role="list" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>fix your dropdown population</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>fix your renderer</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>fix your registry</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>fix your UI labels</strong></span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Just tell me:</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>“fix dropdown”</strong> or <strong>“fix registry”</strong> or <strong>“fix UI labels”</strong></span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">I’ll drop the full working file.</span></p></div></div><div class="mt-3"><div data-tabster="{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:true,&quot;tabbable&quot;:true}}" role="too