</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">in the <strong>root</strong> of your repository.
Right now, that file does not exist — so GitHub returns 404.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Here’s how to fix it properly.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">✅ <strong>Step 1 — Create a favicon file</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You can use <strong>any</strong> of these:</span></p><ul role="list" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">a real <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">.ico</code> file</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">a <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">.png</code> converted to <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">.ico</code></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">a simple 32×32 icon</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">even a blank icon</span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">If you don’t have one, you can generate a quick placeholder using any favicon generator.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">✅ <strong>Step 2 — Add it to the root of your repo</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Your repo structure should look like:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">Code</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.