It must be in the <strong>root</strong>, not inside <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">/modules</code>, <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">/ui</code>, or <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">/assets</code>.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">✅ <strong>Step 3 — Commit and push</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Example commit message:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">Code</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm">Add favicon.ico to fix GitHub Pages 404
</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Once pushed, GitHub Pages will immediately stop requesting a missing file.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ <strong>Optional but recommended</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Add this to your <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">&lt;head&gt;</code> in <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">index.html</code>:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">html</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative m