✅ <strong>The version that fixes the favicon 404 permanently</strong>  
✅ <strong>No extra noise</strong></span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Let’s fix it cleanly.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">📁 <strong>FILEPATH (must be EXACT)</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Place this file in the <strong>root</strong> of your GitHub Pages repo:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">Code</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm">/favicon.ico
</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Not inside <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">/ui/</code>, not inside <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">/modules/</code>, not inside <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">/assets/</code>.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">GitHub Pages ONLY checks the root.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ <strong>FULL CODE (index.html update)</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Add this inside the <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">&lt;head&gt;</code> of your <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">index.html</code>:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">html</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm"><span initial="start" animate="end" variants="[object Object]" custom="0"><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">link</span> <span class="hljs-attr">rel</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"icon"</span> <span class="hljs-attr">href</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"./favicon.ico"</span>&gt;</span></span><span initial="start" animate="end" variants="[object Object]" custom="0">
</span></code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">This tells the browser:</span></p><ul role="list" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">“Use this favicon”</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">“Don’t auto‑request /favicon.ico”</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">“Don’t throw a 404”</span></p></li></ul><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ <strong>If you don’t have a favicon yet</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">You can create a blank one instantly.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Create a file named:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">Code</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm">favicon.ico
</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Put <strong>anything</strong> inside it — even a 0‑byte file works.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">But here is a minimal valid ICO file (1×1 pixel black icon):</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">Code</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm">000001000100010100000100200068000000160000002800000001000000010000000100200000000000040000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000
</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Save that hex as <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">favicon.ico</code> using any online hex‑to‑file tool.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Or easier: create a 32×32 PNG and convert it to <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">.ico</code> using any favicon generator.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ <strong>Your repo should look like this:</strong></h1><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-static-250 text-sm dark:border-stroke-250 dark:bg-background-static-900 rounded-t-xl"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="capitalize">Code</span><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Collapse code snippet" aria-expanded="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-4 transition-transform -rotate-90"><path d="M8.46967 4.21967C8.17678 4.51256 8.17678 4.98744 8.46967 5.28033L15.1893 12L8.46967 18.7197C8.17678 19.0126 8.17678 19.4874 8.46967 19.7803C8.76256 20.0732 9.23744 20.0732 9.53033 19.7803L16.7803 12.5303C17.0732 12.2374 17.0732 11.7626 16.7803 11.4697L9.53033 4.21967C9.23744 3.92678 8.76256 3.92678 8.46967 4.21967Z"></path></svg></button></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><button class="relative min-h-9 min-w-9 gap-1.5 rounded-xl bg-transparent p-2 hover:bg-white/8 active:bg-white/5" type="button" title="Copy code" data-copy="false"><div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5"><path d="M5.5028 4.62704L5.5 6.75V17.2542C5.5 19.0491 6.95507 20.5042 8.75 20.5042L17.3663 20.5045C17.0573 21.3782 16.224 22.0042 15.2444 22.0042H8.75C6.12665 22.0042 4 19.8776 4 17.2542V6.75C4 5.76929 4.62745 4.93512 5.5028 4.62704ZM17.75 2C18.9926 2 20 3.00736 20 4.25V17.25C20 18.4926 18.9926 19.5 17.75 19.5H8.75C7.50736 19.5 6.5 18.4926 6.5 17.25V4.25C6.5 3.00736 7.50736 2 8.75 2H17.75ZM17.75 3.5H8.75C8.33579 3.5 8 3.83579 8 4.25V17.25C8 17.6642 8.33579 18 8.75 18H17.75C18.1642 18 18.5 17.6642 18.5 17.25V4.25C18.5 3.83579 18.1642 3.5 17.75 3.5Z"></path></svg> Copy</div></button></div></div><div class="rounded-b-xl bg-background-static-850 px-4 pb-1.5 dark:bg-background-static-900"><div class="horizontal-scrollbar overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre pb-3 pt-4 text-sm"><pre><code class="font-ligatures-none text-sm">HF-Antenna-Designer/
│
├── favicon.ico      ← FIXES THE 404
├── index.html
├── modules/
├── ui/
├── styles/
└── README.md
</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Once this file exists, the 404 disappears instantly.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ If you want, I can generate a clean custom favicon for you</h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Just tell me:</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>“make me a favicon”</strong></span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">and I’ll design one that matches your HF Antenna Designer branding.</span></p></div></div><div class="mt-3"><div data-tabster="{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:true,&quot;tabbable&quot;:true}}" role="toolbar" class="flex opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out items-center group-focus-within/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-focus-within/ai-message:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message:opacity-100" data-copy="false" data-testid="message-item-reactions"><button aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl after:absolute after:inset-0 after:pointer-events-none after:border after:border-transparent after:contrast-more:border-2 outline-2 outline-offset-1 focus-visible:z-[1] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-stroke-900 forced-colors:transition-none forced-colors:safe-hover:!bg-[Highlight] forced-colors:safe-hover:!text-[HighlightText] forced-co