2.2837 18.7779C12.0176 19.044 11.6012 19.0683 11.3076 18.8507L11.2235 18.7782L6.22003 13.7816C5.92694 13.4889 5.92661 13.014 6.21931 12.7209C6.48539 12.4545 6.90204 12.43 7.1958 12.6477L7.27997 12.7202L10.999 16.4339L11 2.75586C11 2.37616 11.2822 2.06237 11.6482 2.01271L11.75 2.00586L11.6482 2.01271Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></button></span></div></div><div class="group/ai-message-item space-y-3 break-words" id="pme6pDF3cQJwfxeH4CyHG-content-1"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Your favicon is ready now — let’s wire it into your project cleanly so the 404 disappears for good.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Below is <strong>exactly what you asked for</strong>:</span></p><ul role="list" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">the <strong>filepath</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">the <strong>full code you must add</strong></span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">the <strong>final structure your repo should have</strong></span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">No extra noise.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">📁 <strong>1. FILEPATH — where to put the favicon</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Place the generated favicon file here:</span></p><div class="rounded-xl dark:border dark:border-stroke-250" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between border-b border-white/20 bg-background-static-850 py-2 pe-2.5 ps-4 text-foreground-