</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Then commit and push it to your repo root.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">🎉 <strong>Done</strong></h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Once you:</span></p><ul role="list" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">add <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">favicon.ico</code> to the repo root</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">add the <code class="font-ligatures-none mx-0.5 rounded-[4px] border border-stroke-300 bg-accent-200/60 px-1 py-px font-mono text-foreground-800 text-sm dark:bg-accent-200" style="opacity: 1;">&lt;link rel="icon"&gt;</code> tag</span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">…the 404 disappears permanently.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">If you want, I can also generate:</span></p><ul role="list" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">a dark‑mode favicon</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">a high‑res app icon</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">a matching logo for your HF Antenna Designer</span></p></li></ul><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Just say the word.</span></p></div></div><div class="mt-3"><div data-tabster="{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:true,&quot;tabbable&quot;:true}}" role="toolbar" class="flex opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out items-center group-focus-within/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-focus-within/ai-message:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message:opacity-100" data-copy="false" data-testid="message-item-reactions"><button aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl after:absolute after:inset-0 after:pointer-events-none after:border after:border-transparent after:contrast-more:border-2 outline-2 outline-offset-1 focus-visible:z-[1] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-stroke-900 forced-colors:transition-none forced-colors:safe-hover:!bg-[Highlight] forced-colors:safe-hover:!text-[HighlightText] forced-colors:safe-hover:!fill-[HighlightText] forced-colors:active:!bg-[Highlight] forced-colors:active:!text-[HighlightText] forced-colors:active:!fill-[HighlightText]" data-testid="message-thumbs-up-button" data-spatial-navigation-autofocus="false" data-tooltip-state="closed"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.7002 2.01074C11.0952 2.06005 11.4528 2.2785 11.6768 2.61426C12.2133 3.41901 12.5 4.36484 12.5 5.33203V5.95312C12.5 6.64737 12.3947 7.33709 12.1904 8H15.6914C16.9663 8 18 9.03369 18 10.3086C18 10.471 17.9832 10.6331 17.9492 10.792L16.