ap" style="gap: 4px;"><h3 class="text-foreground-750 text-md-strong text-start">Open the image</h3></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Opening the image ensures you save the full‑resolution version.</span></p><ul role="list" class="relative list-outside marker:text-foreground-750 dark:marker:text-foreground-600 flex flex-col ms-4 px-1"><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Click the image once</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">It will open in a larger preview window</span></p></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-[1px] border-black/10 dark:border-white/10" style="margin-block: 16px; border-block-start-width: 1px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class=""><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch justify-start flex-nowrap" role="listitem" aria-label="Save the image to your computer" style="gap: 0px;"><div class="contents"><div class="" style="padding-inline-end: 8px; width: 32px;"><div class="flex flex-col items-end justify-start flex-nowrap size-full"><div class="contents"><div class="" style="padding-block-start: 4px; height: 22px;"><div class="flex flex-row items-center justify-end flex-nowrap size-full"><h3 class="text-foreground-750 text-md-strong text-start">03</h3></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="" style="width: 12px;"><div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-start flex-nowrap size-full"><div class="contents"><div class="bg-stroke-300 forced-colors:border forced-colors:border-[CanvasText]" style="width: 1px; height: 8px;"><div class="flex flex-col items-stretch justify-start flex-nowrap size-full"></div></div></div><div class="contents"><div class="bg-stroke-300 forced-colors:border forced-colors:border-[CanvasText] rounded-full overflow-hidden" style="width: 9px; height: 9px;"><div class