span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Open Developer Tools → Console</span></p></li><li class="ps-2" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Confirm the favicon 404 is gone</span></p></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t-[1px] border-black/10 dark:border-white/10" style="margin-block: 16px; border-block-start-width: 1px;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="group/ai-message-item space-y-3 break-words" id="FGoUVDp2KSWKWcP9zCvAq-content-2"><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">If you want, I can <strong>regenerate the favicon image</strong> right now so it appears at the bottom of this chat for easy saving — just say:</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>“regenerate favicon image”</strong></span></p></div></div><div class="mt-3"><div data-tabster="{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:true,&quot;tabbable&quot;:true}}" role="toolbar" class="flex opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out items-center group-focus-within/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-focus-within/ai-message:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message:opacity-100" data-copy="false" data-testid="message-item-reactions"><button aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl aft