</code></pre></div></div></div><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Commit and push.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Done.</span></p><div class="relative pb-6 w-full after:border-b after:border-stroke-300 after:w-full after:absolute after:mt-3"></div><h1 class="text-2xl-medium [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:pt-6">⭐ If you want, I can show the favicon image again</h1><p wotshield="true"><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">So you can save it properly using the steps above.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Just say:</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>“show favicon again”</strong></span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">and I’ll display it.</span></p></div></div><div class="mt-3"><div data-tabster="{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:true,&quot;tabbable&quot;:true}}" role="toolbar" class="flex opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out items-center group-focus-within/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-focus-within/ai-message:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message:opacity-100" data-copy="false" data-testid="message-item-reactions"><button aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl after:absolute after:inset-0 after:pointer-events-none after:border after:border-transparent after:contrast-more:border-2 outline-2 outline-offset-1 focus-visible:z-[1] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-stroke-900 forced-colors:transition-none for