iv><div class="min-h-[calc(100%-56px)] flex shrink-0 flex-col" data-testid="highlighted-chats" style=""><div class="pt-3 pb-6 inline-block w-full space-y-8" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div data-tabster="{&quot;groupper&quot;:{&quot;tabbability&quot;:2},&quot;focusable&quot;:{}}" class="group/user-message space-y-1" id="JSt9HztSSX3iRG2smFve4-user-message" aria-labelledby="JSt9HztSSX3iRG2smFve4-user-message" tabindex="0" role="article"><div class="relative space-y-3"><h5 class="sr-only" aria-label="Participant Pat said" data-copy="false">Participant Pat said</h5><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1"><div class="px-10 text-foreground-600 text-xs" aria-hidden="true">Pat</div><div class="flex w-full items-start"><div class="z-10 -me-2 mt-2 size-8 shrink-0" role="presentation"><div class="relative size-full rounded-full aspect-square flex items-center justify-center uppercase after:absolute after:-inset-px after:rounded-full after:border-[0.5px] after:border-black/10 dark:after:border-white/20 text-base-medium text-white" style="background-color: rgb(62, 55, 22);"><div>P</div></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1"><div class="flex gap-2 justify-start"><div class="font-ligatures-none relative h-fit max-w-user-text-message whitespace-pre-wrap break-words px-4 py-2.5 squircle-16 bg-white dark:bg-accent-100 text-base self-start" data-content="user-message"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 border-squircle-card border-accent-200 squircle-stroke-16 dark:border-accent-300" aria-hidden="true"></div>it's my work computer preventing this - will open using my personal laptop. Let's put a pin in this til I get infront of a different piece of hardware</div><div role="group" class="relative z-10 flex opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out group-focus-within/user-message:opacity-100 group-hover/user-message:opacity-100 items-center mt-auto" data-copy="false" data-testid="user-message-reactions"><div class="relative"><button aria-label="Copy message" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl after:absolute after:inset-0 after:pointer-events-none after:border after:border-transparent after:contrast-more:border-2 outline-2 outline-offset-1 focus-visible:z-[1] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-stroke-900 forced-colors:transition-none forced-colors:safe-hover:!bg-[Highlight] forced-colors:safe-hover:!text-[HighlightText] forced-colors:safe-hover:!fill-[HighlightText] forced-colors:active:!bg-[Highlight] forced-colors:active:!text-[HighlightText] forced-colors:active:!fill-[HighlightText]" data-testid="copy-user-message-button" data-spatial-navigation-autofocus="false" data-tooltip-state="closed"><div style="opacity: 1;"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-5"><path d="M8 2C6.89543 2 6 2.89543 6 4V14C6 15.1046 6.89543 16 8 16H14C15.1046 16 16 15.1046 16 14V4C16 2.89543 15.1046 2 14 2H8ZM7 4C7 3.44772 7.44772 3 8 3H14C14.5523 3 15 3.44772 15 4V14C15 14.5523 14.5523 15 14 15H8C7.44772 15 7 14.5523 7 14V4ZM4 6.00001C4 5.25973 4.4022 4.61339 5 4.26758V14.5C5 15.8807 6.11929 17 7.5 17H13.7324C13.3866 17.5978 12.7403 18 12 18H7.5C5.567 18 4 16.433 4 14.5V6.00001Z"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-tabster="{&quot;groupper&quot;:{&quot;tabbability&quot;:2},&quot;focusable&quot;:{}}" class="group/ai-message" data-content="ai-message" data-testid="ai-message" aria-labelledby="TCYiJjiYvysnChZKCHmtU-author TCYiJjiYvysnChZKCHmtU-content-0" tabindex="0" role="article"><div class="relative"><h6 id="TCYiJjiYvysnChZKCHmtU-author" class="sr-only" aria-label="Copilot said" data-copy="false">Copilot said</h6></div><div class="space-y-3 mt-3"><div class="group/ai-message-item space-y-3 break-words" id="TCYiJjiYvysnChZKCHmtU-content-0"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Totally fine, Pat — switching machines is the right move.
Let’s pause the favicon work until you’re on hardware that isn’t locked down.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">And just so you don’t lose the thread when you come back, here’s a clean marker you can return to:</span></p><blockquote class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-s-2 border-foreground-300 ps-3" style="opacity: 1;"><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap"><strong>Next action when you're on your personal laptop:</strong>  
<strong><span class="text-start underline-offset-[0.25em] underline decoration-dotted decoration-foreground-450 decoration-2 hover:decoration-solid hover:cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" data-url="ca://s?q=show_favicon_again">show favicon again</span></strong></span></p></blockquote><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">That will bring the icon back on screen so you can save it properly.</span></p><p><span class="font-ligatures-none whitespace-pre-wrap">Whenever you’re ready, we’ll pick up right where we left off — no re‑explaining, no re‑debugging.</span></p></div></div><div class="mt-3"><div data-tabster="{&quot;mover&quot;:{&quot;cyclic&quot;:false,&quot;direction&quot;:2,&quot;memorizeCurrent&quot;:true,&quot;tabbable&quot;:true}}" role="toolbar" class="flex transition-opacity duration-300 ease-in-out items-center group-focus-within/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message-item:opacity-100 group-focus-within/ai-message:opacity-100 group-hover/ai-message:opacity-100 opacity-100" data-copy="false" data-testid="message-item-reactions"><button aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" type="button" class="relative flex items-center text-foreground-800 fill-foreground-800 active:text-foreground-600 active:fill-foreground-600 dark:active:text-foreground-650 dark:active:fill-foreground-650 bg-transparent safe-hover:bg-black/5 active:bg-black/3 dark:safe-hover:bg-white/8 dark:active:bg-white/5 text-sm justify-center size-9 rounded-xl after:rounded-xl after:absolute after:inset-0 after:pointer-events-none after:border after:border-transparent after:contrast-more:border-2 outline-2 outline-offset-1 focus-visible:z-[1] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-stroke-900 forced-colors:transition-none forced-colors:safe-hover:!bg-[Highlight] forced-colors:safe-hover:!text-[HighlightText] forced-colors:safe-hover:!fill-[HighlightText] forced-colors:active:!bg-[Highlight] forced-colors:active:!text-[HighlightText] forced-colors:a